WEBVTT

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.100
I'm home.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.250
Welcome back.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:39.580
Mom!

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:44.260
What's wrong, Akari? 
Did something happen?

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:46.990
<b>Tasty News

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:46.990
<b>Marine Day</b>

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:46.990
<b>Squid Ink Pasta</b>

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:46.990
<b>Half Off Tomorrow Only<i>!!</i></b>

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:46.990
Huh?

00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:56.000
<b>The Start of a New Journey!!</b>

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:56.000
<b>The Great Tokyo Showdown!!</b>

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:53.420
The Start of a New Journey!! 
The Great Tokyo Showdown!!

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.900
It's true! You've gotta believe me!

00:01:00.690 --> 00:01:03.020
You had such a big adventure between

00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:05.340
lunchtime and this evening?

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:07.080
That must've been one busy day.

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:09.490
Dad, you, too?

00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:12.450
I have pictures to prove it!

00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:17.060
Huh? That's odd...

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:19.970
I know I took some with our 
Digimon friends, too...

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:22.930
I only see Taiki and that weird boy!

00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:25.630
I told you...

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:28.180
We went to the Digital World!

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:33.910
Come on, Taiki's Mom, believe us!

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:39.480
And you used that cool toy 
you call a Xros Loader

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:41.200
to beat the bad Digimon,

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:45.350
and came home just before you 
could save the Digital World?

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:46.320
Yes!

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:50.090
And you did all that in only half a day?

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:50.950
Uh huh!

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:53.260
She finally gets it!

00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:54.610
Taiki,

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:57.500
you should become a novelist or 
scenario writer or something.

00:01:58.050 --> 00:01:58.630
Huh?

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:01.450
My special ramen is going to get soggy.

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:02.960
Hurry up and eat.

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:07.210
When you have the 
continuation, tell me, okay?

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:12.050
I should've known...

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:15.310
She'd never believe me.

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:18.200
What's happening? A blackout?

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:21.310
It can't be...

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:27.660
What is going on?

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:40.200
Shoutmon...

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:42.490
Yeah. Something feels very wrong.

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:46.690
Taiki Kudou.

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:50.330
That voice...

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:51.150
It's the one I heard back then!

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:56.420
You're the one who gave 
me the Xros Loader!

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:57.710
Yes.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.700
I am the one who chose you

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.440
and led you to the Digital World.

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:06.100
I believed you could 
change it for the better.

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:07.840
Who are you?

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:08.830
Where are you?

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:12.890
But unfortunately, 
that is no longer possible.

00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:14.410
Wait! Hey!

00:03:14.410 --> 00:03:17.500
Hey, Taiki, what was that voice?

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:18.780
I don't know.

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:19.810
But...

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:22.660
Something's about to happen.

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:33.120
Hey, Akari.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:34.090
Zenjirou!

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:36.790
Taiki!

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:38.270
Hey!

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:43.540
My dad said I must have been dreaming.

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:45.160
My mom thought I made it up.

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.730
My family, too.

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:50.440
And nobody else can see Shoutmon.

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:56.210
To think nobody believes we 
had that huge adventure...

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:58.930
You can't blame them. We have no proof.

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:03.550
Nope. He doesn't show up.

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:08.620
I actually manage to come to your world,

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:11.470
and I can't touch anything 
and nobody notices me.

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:13.360
What a drag!

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:19.970
Hey, guys, hang out with me today.

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:22.070
We'll start with this.

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:25.580
Squid ink pasta!

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:31.380
I think the passage of time in the 
Digital World is different from here.

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:33.990
Wow, that looks tasty!

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:38.740
What's wrong, Akari?

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:40.540
I thought you wanted to eat this stuff.

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:42.230
I did, but...

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:45.530
This was the one good thing about 
the time passing differently, huh?

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:47.960
Come on, eat up!

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:52.300
Ah, I'm stuffed.

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:55.110
I guess it didn't taste too bad.

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:58.410
Okay, you're next, Zenjirou.

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:00.800
That's my...

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:02.980
Thanks for this, Akari.

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:04.980
You went to get it?

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:07.590
We were going to settle 
the score, right?

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:09.320
I'm gonna take this seriously!

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:12.180
Hang on, Taiki Kudou...

00:05:12.180 --> 00:05:13.980
What are you up to?

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:17.000
Taiki, don't tell me you're...

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:23.740
Yeah. I'm...

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:26.600
going back to the Digital 
World with Shoutmon.

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:28.340
What?

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:33.750
You heard that voice again?

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:34.970
Yeah.

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:37.190
I'm going to look for 
whoever it belongs to,

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:38.850
and ask for their help one more time...

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:42.420
to send Shoutmon and me 
back to the Digital World.

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:45.660
What are you saying?! <i>This</i> is our world!

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:48.220
But now I know...

00:05:48.220 --> 00:05:50.770
there's another world out 
there that supports life.

00:05:51.570 --> 00:05:54.880
And I love that world, with all its 
Digimon trying their best to survive!

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:57.200
Even if they're monsters made of data,

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:00.140
they cry and laugh just like us.

00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:03.110
They're our precious friends 
who have fought by our sides.

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:07.050
So I want one more chance.

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:10.680
One more chance to fight and 
change the Digital World.

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:14.350
I've made my decision.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:20.120
Besides, I can't turn my back on Nene 
and Kiriha, who are still there.

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:23.880
And we can't turn our backs on you!

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:24.560
That's right!

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:27.910
We love everyone in Xros Heart, too!

00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:30.400
Akari... Zenjirou...

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:34.670
You were trying to grant 
our wishes before you left?

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:37.440
Don't give me that! 
This doesn't even matter!

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:42.700
I'm sorry, Zenjirou... Akari.

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:49.250
Is that truly what you 
want, Taiki Kudou?

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:51.540
I heard it! It's that voice!

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:09.250
This is...

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:10.940
The place where I got my Xros Loader.

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:12.800
That's right!

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:15.310
This is where Taiki saved my life!

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:19.920
A DigiMemory!

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:24.520
You've found me.

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:33.930
I am Omegamon.

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:35.720
Omegamon?

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:46.810
Wh-What's that? What's going on?

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:52.720
I just saw something!

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:25.410
Omegamon?

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:28.070
It has been a long time, Taiki Kudou...

00:09:28.070 --> 00:09:29.580
And Shoutmon.

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:36.150
I'm back to my normal size!

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:38.490
You gave me the Xros Loader?

00:09:38.490 --> 00:09:39.870
Yes.

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:42.670
I was a member of an 
order of knights that

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:46.630
protected the will of justice 
in the Digital World.

00:09:47.030 --> 00:09:50.270
However, unable to stop 
the division of our world,

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:53.980
we were turned into DigiMemories 
and scattered far and wide.

00:09:54.810 --> 00:09:58.440
Being the only one to 
land in the human world,

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:00.460
I searched and searched for someone

00:10:00.460 --> 00:10:03.970
who could hear the melodies of Digimon.

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:08.520
<b>Omegamon</b>

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:08.520
<b>Grey Sword</b>

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:08.520
That is how the DigiMemories came to be.

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:14.110
I want to go back to the Digital 
World to save my friends.

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:15.810
Me, too!

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:16.430
And me!

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:20.140
Please, help us, Omegamon.

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:25.000
Only a life of painful battles 
awaits you if you return.

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:26.660
We're prepared for that.

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:29.310
Taiki...

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:31.270
I have heard your wishes...

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:33.880
and your resolve.

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:35.490
Very well.

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:40.920
However, only Taiki Kudou may return.

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:41.870
What?

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:43.090
Only him?

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:49.030
That alone will require me to 
use the last of my ability.

00:10:49.030 --> 00:10:49.960
I am sorry.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:52.230
Akari... Zenjirou...

00:10:57.900 --> 00:10:59.100
Listen to me.

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:04.840
Not having the two of you is a 
huge blow to Team Xros Heart.

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:09.220
Akari, you always cheered us up 
with a smile when we were down.

00:11:11.050 --> 00:11:16.020
Zenjirou, you led the team 
in battle when I couldn't.

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:18.400
You're both true warriors.

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:22.540
I want the three of us to go back 
to the Digital World together.

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:26.530
But we can't waste time 
looking for a way to do that.

00:11:26.860 --> 00:11:28.380
While we're here,

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:32.370
time is passing several times 
faster in the Digital World.

00:11:32.890 --> 00:11:36.450
If, by some miracle, you guys 
are able to come back too...

00:11:36.450 --> 00:11:37.860
then follow me.

00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:39.340
Okay.

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:42.140
I'll fight for all three of us.

00:11:42.140 --> 00:11:43.160
All right.

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:44.880
We're counting on you, Taiki Kudou.

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:46.360
Leave it to me!

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:50.090
Now, take my DigiMemory to an open place

00:11:50.090 --> 00:11:52.220
and use it there.

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:00.130
Tactimon!

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:01.870
What's that? What's going on?!

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:08.220
He's just like I was before now!

00:12:08.220 --> 00:12:10.540
The humans can't see him!

00:12:11.030 --> 00:12:13.710
He was sent to the human 
world along with us.

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:17.640
Then he absorbed digital 
energy to be reborn!

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:21.340
He can't control himself!

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:28.130
You are Taiki Kudou!

00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:30.360
He saw us!

00:12:30.360 --> 00:12:32.190
Wretched boy!

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:40.510
Huh?

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:42.270
What's that?

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:49.230
Man, what is going on?

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.740
<i>We've got to get somewhere with 
as few people as possible!</i>

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:09.980
S-Something's there!

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:11.600
Wh-What is that?!

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:17.580
Power is filling me.

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:21.940
I never knew the human world was 
full of so much digital power!

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:25.850
I must tell Lord Bagramon about this!

00:13:25.850 --> 00:13:28.120
He's gonna tell Bagramon 
about the human world!

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:31.190
We will rule this world as well!

00:13:31.190 --> 00:13:33.060
I'll never let you!

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:35.010
Rowdy Rocke—

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:38.020
Fool.

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:39.690
Remember your place!

00:13:41.030 --> 00:13:42.780
Don't be reckless, Shoutmon!

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:44.780
Even if you're back to your normal size,

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:47.130
he's an opponent you couldn't 
stand up to in the first place!

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:48.730
And you can't DigiXros.

00:13:48.730 --> 00:13:50.310
You're on your own here!

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:53.100
I'm not alone.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:54.610
You guys are here.

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:58.400
You think I'm going to 
let them have their way

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:01.350
with Taiki, Akari, and 
Zenjirou's hometown?!

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:02.550
<b>Darkdramon</b>

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:02.550
<b>Gigastick Lance</b>

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:04.590
DigiMemory!

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:10.700
Gigastick Lance, activate!

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:28.050
Without that, Taiki can't go back!

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:34.450
Zenjirou! Akari!

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:40.360
Cast aside your Xros Loader,

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:42.690
or these two are dead!

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:45.330
Th-That creep...

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:47.180
Make it quick!

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:48.520
No!

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:53.840
Taiki! Don't listen to him!

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:56.670
Yeah! Fight him, Taiki Kudou!

00:14:57.070 --> 00:14:59.780
We're part of Xros Heart, too!

00:14:59.780 --> 00:15:01.610
Just take him out now!

00:15:02.680 --> 00:15:05.910
This is not the time to joke, insects!

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:09.090
What did you call us?! We're...

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:10.560
We're...

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:14.840
We're not insects!

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:17.350
What?!

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:20.890
What is this?! It burns!

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:26.600
Akari and Zenjirou's power...

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:31.900
What is this?

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:35.510
Taiki, I can feel incredible 
power boiling up in me!

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:38.640
Digivolve, Shoutmon.

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:40.150
Digivolve?

00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:44.380
Shoutmon!

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.140
Digivolve!

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:50.860
Shoutmon, Digivolve!

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:55.790
OmegaShoutmon!

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:06.180
He Digivolved in an instant?!

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:07.390
Ridiculous!

00:16:07.390 --> 00:16:12.280
It took years for me to 
Digivolve to this form!

00:16:16.390 --> 00:16:17.920
Shoutmon changed?!

00:16:18.260 --> 00:16:20.660
That is his future form.

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:23.220
The courage in Akari's heart

00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:25.620
and the friendship in Zenjirou's heart

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:28.460
have given new power to the Xros Loader.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:32.170
It has granted Shoutmon the 
instant power to Digivolve.

00:16:32.480 --> 00:16:34.640
We had that kind of power?

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:37.800
It appears that your being 
taken to the Digital World

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:39.680
was no coincidence.

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:53.810
Could those be the Digimon 
Taiki was talking about?

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:00.870
It's no use, Tactimon.

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:02.270
What did you say?!

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:06.670
I'm saying that dull sword

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:11.630
can't even leave a scratch on 
the power born from our bond!

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:13.800
Don't make me laugh!

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:17.200
Save it until you've tasted the 
ultimate technique of my sword

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:20.550
now that it has absorbed the vast 
digital power of the human world!

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:38.640
Ultimate technique: San-no-Tachi!

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:42.640
No... Shi-no-Tachi!

00:17:43.800 --> 00:17:46.410
That's gonna blow away the whole city!

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:51.930
<b>Hard Rock Damashi</b>

00:17:52.740 --> 00:17:54.020
OmegaShoutmon!

00:17:54.020 --> 00:17:55.830
Use Hard Rock Damashi!

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:57.220
You got it!

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:58.960
I'll let you hear my...

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:01.830
Hard Rock Damashi!

00:18:11.100 --> 00:18:14.170
Beat Slash!

00:18:33.370 --> 00:18:34.940
No!

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:39.710
My loyal spirit is scattering 
to the human world!

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:09.930
My Digivolution wore off.

00:19:09.930 --> 00:19:11.960
You will be able to do it again,

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:15.000
as long as you remember 
the strong bond you share.

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:19.890
Thanks, Akari, Zenjirou.

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:21.940
You gave us the best gift ever.

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:23.230
Taiki...

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:25.210
Akari?

00:19:25.210 --> 00:19:29.380
Please be careful, Taiki... Shoutmon.

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:34.710
Akari... we'll be fine.

00:19:35.510 --> 00:19:39.460
We'll save everyone in the 
Digital World, no matter what.

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:41.250
You'd better!

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:44.360
I'll take a rain check on 
our kendo match until then.

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:46.660
Later, you two!

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:53.500
Time to go, General of Xros Heart.

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:01.010
I'm off.

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:13.700
The Digital World is most 
likely a world of evil now.

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:16.290
I'm depending on you, Taiki Kudou,

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:18.670
boy who can bring about miracles.

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:24.600
We'll find a way there to 
help you, no matter what!

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:29.010
